T*
(Notice: Rules for the rice export exemptions) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P1] The Realm Trade Ministry has published the rules for the exemptions in the) Tj
T*
(notice of 5 December 2026.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P2] Premium aromatic rice is rice that meets the ministry's aroma and grade) Tj
T*
(standard. It must be packed and labelled separately from ordinary white rice.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P3] A government-to-government contract qualifies only if it was signed before) Tj
T*
(1 October 2026 and names the buyer, the volume and the delivery period.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P4] The contract volumes may continue after the ban. The exporter must present) Tj
T*
(the contract and a matching shipment declaration at the port.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P5] Sales outside the contract, including spot sales to the same buyer, are) Tj
T*
(treated as ordinary white rice and are prohibited.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P6] The ministry will review the exemption list if the domestic supply position) Tj
T*
(changes.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P7] The rules are intended to give the ministry a clear record of each shipment) Tj
T*
(and of the buyer who receives it.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P8] Exporters should keep copies of the contract and of the shipping documents) Tj
T*
(that match each approved volume.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P9] The ministry will publish any change to the exemption list in the same) Tj
T*
(gazette.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P10] Signed: Priya Lund, trade official, Vanir.) Tj
T*
() Tj
